  "notes": [
    "upstream/ is the author's sy-drum/ at v2.14 plus the one file its manifest reads from his synth/ (engine_abi.inc) and his LICENSE at v2.14. v2.14 (39dc5d8) changes sy-drum/ only against v2.13 (48b89e7, FM Synth 0.1.5's pin): the step-lock card code (tools/locks_io.c and the generated locks_io.inc.s: the lock files written while the sequencer plays, and read whatever the stock bank load returned), one new LOCK_HOOKS row (0x4005224a, sl_io_tick_hook), tools/gen_locks_io.py and README.md.",
    "The author's native conflicts (KITS, PLOCKS P2, STEM REC: octabam modules outside this catalogue) are cleared in manifest.py and listed in octamod.module.json and README.md.",
    "Stock spans: stock-guards.json (53 detour sites). No stock bytes are stored."
  ]
}
